# JOURNEY · a Common is told apart by its looks: a Bitfish bought in the shop is written in binary,
# its bits flipping as it sways, so the stills show it and the expects read its name.

clear
include scenes/start-with-a-stake.play
include scenes/buy-a-fish.play Bitfish Byte
run /index
expect Byte
expect Bitfish
snap the bitfish in the index
key esc
absent Byte
run /show "Byte"
expect FishResource#show
expect Bitfish
snap the bitfish's show card, written in bits
key esc
absent FishResource#show
